meta {
  name: dispute
}

docs {
  TRZ-16 and TRZ-18 against a running API with the synthetic fixture and DEMO_MODE=true.
  Run the folder in order on a freshly seeded database (make seed-synthetic REPLACE=1): a
  registered dispute stays open, so a second run escalates the same charge on purpose.

  01 to 06: the recognition step. The charge is shown from the database with the two
  buttons; "Ya lo reconozco" closes the case, "Sigo sin reconocerlo" goes to the policy.
  07 to 09: the confirmation names the pending action: it registers with a folio, a double
  send returns the same folio, and the action of another case runs nothing. The registration
  is read back before it is confirmed (registered_verified), and the receipt cites the policy
  passage of its deadline.
  10 to 15: the choice among options. Only an id that was shown is accepted; "none"
  escalates; any other id stops the case for security.
}
